# SPA rewrite for Netlify/Cloudflare Pages. Render does not read this file; its
# Static Site takes the rewrite from the dashboard (Redirects/Rewrites tab). This
# only matters if the frontend moves off Render.
#
# React Router uses BrowserRouter, so without a rewrite a hard load of /project/4
# or F5 on /account asks the host for a file that does not exist, and the host
# answers with its own 404 instead of NotFound.jsx.
#
# 200, not 301: a redirect would put /index.html in the address bar and the router
# would lose the path it was asked for.
/*  /index.html  200
